            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you depend on your trucks to deliver every day, quality isn't optional; it's essential. Every mile, every load, and every stop adds up, and the smallest parts can make the biggest difference.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For owner-operators and fleet managers, maintaining uptime starts with using genuine International® truck parts designed specifically for your vehicle.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, Florida's exclusive International® truck dealer, we know what it takes to keep your fleet reliable and road-ready. From filters and brake systems to engines and electronics, OEM parts deliver the durability, safety, and performance your business depends on.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-genuine",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Choose Genuine International® Truck Parts",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-genuine"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-genuine-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it comes to replacements, it's tempting to look for cheaper aftermarket options. But what might save a few dollars up front can cost far more down the road. Genuine OEM truck parts are built to the exact specifications of your International® truck, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal performance every time. Here's why OEM parts stand apart:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-why-genuine-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Precision engineering designed specifically for International® models"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Proven reliability tested under extreme conditions"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Warranty-backed protection through International®'s nationwide parts warranty"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Long-term savings from fewer breakdowns and better fuel efficiency"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-genuine-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Using OEM parts isn't just about maintaining a truck; it's about protecting your investment and keeping your business on schedule.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-why-genuine-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-why-genuine-4",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
                          "borderColor": "line",
                          "paddingTop": 26,
                          "paddingRight": 28,
